itting there  and and i don't like i've never like  write it out long hand 10 times it's not  that in-depth  uh study in my opinion it's more the  sort of it's quali it's quantity over  quality because not only are you then  exposing yourself to that particular  verb ending in different situations but  as you're listening to it you're also  reviewing all of the other words and  making your brain more and more familiar  with with how the language works so  there you have it about noticing i hope  that was useful and this weekend i  promise i will do my video in portuguese  and tonight i'm having dinner with a  brazilian couple so thank you for  listening bye for now
 

